         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 1.35,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•Kiesselbach plexus = anastomosis of anterior ethmoidal · sphenopalatine · greater palatine & superior labial aa."
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 1.35,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•MC type (more common in peds) - unilat bleed"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 1.35,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
             {
              "type": "bold"
             }
            ],
            "text": "Eti"
           },
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": "
           },
           {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
             {
              "type": "bold"
             },
             {
              "type": "color",
              "attrs": {
               "hex": "009193"
              }
             }
            ],
            "text": "trauma MC (nose picking · facial injuries · forceful nose blowing · rubbing)"
           },
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " · ↓humidity · hot environments · rhinitis · ETOH · cocaine · antiplatelets · FB · bleeding dx · IN corticosteroids"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 1.35,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•also dry mucous membranes · deviated nasal septum - coagulopathies: vWD · hemophilia · thrombocytopenia · Osler-Weber-Rendu"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 1.35,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•most self-limiting - ⍉require hsp - assess resp & hemodynamic stability 1st (abnorm vitals or impaired resp → emergent assessment & airway mgnt)"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 1.35,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          }
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 1.35,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
             {
              "type": "underline",
              "attrs": {
               "style": "single"
              }
             }
            ],
            "text": "Posterior"
           },
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": "
           },
           {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
